msgid "Enable event mode"
msgstr "Enable event mode"

msgid "Event mode"
msgstr "Event mode"

msgid "ffbs-mesh-vpn-parker:event-mode:description"
msgstr ""
"Use the event mode only for large events with more than 1000 clients "
"in one mesh, for example a festival. The node must have 128 MB RAM or more. The uplink node then gives out "
"all addresses of its pool and uses larger tables. This uses more "
"memory. Without the event mode, the node gives out no more than 1024 "
"addresses. Switching the event mode on applies in approximately 30 "
"seconds without a reboot. Switching it off applies only after a reboot."

msgid "ffbs-mesh-vpn-parker:event-mode:no-ram"
msgstr "This node has less than 128 MB RAM. It cannot use the event mode."
